[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3602.87, "timestamp": "01:00:02", "text": "新的。啊。这，这，这是新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3606.069, "timestamp": "01:00:06", "text": "这是正确的。啊，这位虚拟主播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3610.71, "timestamp": "01:00:10", "text": "这是《时尚》杂志六月刊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3614.789, "timestamp": "01:00:14", "text": "但这太神奇了。这不是很神奇吗？惊人的！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3620.589, "timestamp": "01:00:20", "text": "正确的？这是，呃，之前的，呃，封面。在后面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3624.029, "timestamp": "01:00:24", "text": "就是这样。这是背面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3628.71, "timestamp": "01:00:28", "text": "这难道不令人惊叹吗？我想买这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3634.789, "timestamp": "01:00:34", "text": "现在已经是五月了，现在，VTuber们也来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3640.19, "timestamp": "01:00:40", "text": "时尚杂志可能也包含在内。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3646.549, "timestamp": "01:00:46", "text": "但是在哪里呢？在哪里？我试着找找看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3650.27, "timestamp": "01:00:50", "text": "不挂断。我快速看一下。在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3653.19, "timestamp": "01:00:53", "text": "它在哪儿？它在哪儿？在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3657.27, "timestamp": "01:00:57", "text": "是这张照片吗？"}]